                                                "sense_id": "193c3750-5fd0-38bf-b5f6-43cc50f3156a",
                                                "text": "My Lord the great Commander of the worlde,\nBesides fifteene contributory kings,\nHath now in armes ten thouſand Ianiſaries,\nMounted on luſty Mauritanian Steeds, […]"
                                            }
